{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The vanished knights, and the ancient castle twisted into another world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a9af32a8bf1931afc59c902aaf2ef9d1.avif?t=1764337040\" width=1000 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The radiant, glorious empire of Yurationus.</i><br><i>It was an age of peace, but a tragic incident occurred at a fortress on the empire\u2019s frontier.</i><br><i>The lord of the castle went mad and summoned demons, countless people were sacrificed,</i><br><i>and news of the disaster finally reached the imperial capital.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Divine King Lenas immediately dispatched four knights and their order,</i><br><i>the pride of the empire \u2013 but every one of them disappeared.</i><br><i>In the end, the last holy knight, Enoch, and the church sister, Rebecca,</i><br><i>set out to uncover the truth.</i><br><i>The time given to them is only 30 days\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dash through the castle, find hidden power-ups and items, and challenge powerful bosses \u2013 it sticks faithfully to the core formula of a classic Metroidvania.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game 30 days are more than enough time. <strong>This game does not demand a frantic time attack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The real core of the game is how you manage the changing risks and rewards as time passes.</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Castle with Two Faces: Day and Night</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are doors that open <strong>only</strong> during the day, and others that open <strong>only</strong> at night. They\u2019re marked on the map, so try visiting them at the right time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, taking the risk of going out at night to look for shortcuts or farming souls to level up can actually pay off more in the long run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But if you die, it\u2019s all over!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.webm?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.mp4?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/8a94ae472cb9377970860c4e69a7ebf2.webp?t=1764337040\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 While the sun is up, you can explore relatively safely.\u00a0Use that time to expand your map and move around boldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/73cb4ea23cc60399ed1a033f911d0454.webp?t=1764337040\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Once it gets dark, stronger enemies begin to appear and the danger level rises.\u00a0Return to your base quickly and get ready for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a801d4b034aafdc8bce47195ac89a320.webp?t=1764337040\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>When complete darkness falls, an indescribable malice takes over the castle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changes by Date</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, every enemy lurking in the castle gradually grows stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do their appearances change \u2013 they may gain new abilities, and even their attack patterns can change.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1764337040\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1764337040\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1764337040\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7c6878a3fea506bea14d31d3ca5206e7.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7c6878a3fea506bea14d31d3ca5206e7.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purify the Abandoned Chapels!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebecca can purify abandoned chapels and turn them into bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the purification is complete, you\u2019ll have to protect Rebecca from the waves of enemies that keep coming!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.webm?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.mp4?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by finding abandoned chapels and moving your base through purification can you explore deeper into the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once a chapel has been purified, you can use transport to warp there instantly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>A Vast Gothic Castle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From corridors to underground waterways, spires, and otherworldly spaces\u2014run through a castle that\u2019s both beautiful and eerie,\u00a0and discover hidden items and secret shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Story-Driven</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the missing knights and listen to their stories. You\u2019ll follow the process of uncovering the truth behind the tragedy that occurred at this castle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf13 <strong>Changes Over Time</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your day while looking at the map. Actively explore during the daytime, then return safely to your base at night and get ready for tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Five Unique Weapons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain five distinct weapons, each with its own personality,\u00a0and choose the one that fits your play style to upgrade and grow stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>Collect Bibles and Stellastones</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Bibles and Stellastones scattered throughout the castle to unlock Enoch\u2019s abilities and wield powerful holy magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude08\u00a0<strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, no Metroidvania is complete without boss fights! Take on mighty bosses and savor the thrill of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Defense &amp; Purification</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abandoned chapels and purify them.\u00a0A defense mode, where you must protect Sister Rebecca\u00a0from demons attacking from all sides, adds even more tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A hundred years is too soon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/6c7469de1498c24bcf7c9df227214bef15ba4acd.jpg"},{"name":"Fallen Ambition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/b8bb067e6b5e40d1273bae49bb92cf5c93224998.jpg"},{"name":"Cry of Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/22da979573c57b6f57ee1f2d72433e17152238e0.jpg"},{"name":"Equal Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/662a7dcb44bd0d6d48158938be06a619cd9b25c6.jpg"},{"name":"Tarnished Ideal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/4940fd6543caa1ed5b533e404658b74083e1aea5.jpg"},{"name":"The End of Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/a5fecc98988d070f4206f1de3097dca7502410d5.jpg"},{"name":"Vain Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/155be86422456cb585044ee0c0bd336f87b2b5c1.jpg"},{"name":"Zodiac Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/712cb5324d4288354d97d389999cba843bff6bfd.jpg"},{"name":"Bible Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/1c96effe9b522127bad4ddff2e19bed1ed42a4a8.jpg"},{"name":"Weapon Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/46fb43f49c0aef029746729f15eea9014dbfd9a3.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2889740?t=1764337040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/6c1eaf9ca816fb96ef31b740dc8f1dd213cebdf5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764337040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/f724c35795273ce47f3cc15061cae27f02070772/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764337040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/f724c35795273ce47f3cc15061cae27f02070772/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764337040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3278800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The vanished knights, and the ancient castle twisted into another world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a9af32a8bf1931afc59c902aaf2ef9d1.avif?t=1764337040\" width=1000 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The radiant, glorious empire of Yurationus.</i><br><i>It was an age of peace, but a tragic incident occurred at a fortress on the empire\u2019s frontier.</i><br><i>The lord of the castle went mad and summoned demons, countless people were sacrificed,</i><br><i>and news of the disaster finally reached the imperial capital.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Divine King Lenas immediately dispatched four knights and their order,</i><br><i>the pride of the empire \u2013 but every one of them disappeared.</i><br><i>In the end, the last holy knight, Enoch, and the church sister, Rebecca,</i><br><i>set out to uncover the truth.</i><br><i>The time given to them is only 30 days\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dash through the castle, find hidden power-ups and items, and challenge powerful bosses \u2013 it sticks faithfully to the core formula of a classic Metroidvania.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game 30 days are more than enough time. <strong>This game does not demand a frantic time attack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The real core of the game is how you manage the changing risks and rewards as time passes.</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Castle with Two Faces: Day and Night</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are doors that open <strong>only</strong> during the day, and others that open <strong>only</strong> at night. They\u2019re marked on the map, so try visiting them at the right time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, taking the risk of going out at night to look for shortcuts or farming souls to level up can actually pay off more in the long run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But if you die, it\u2019s all over!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.webm?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.mp4?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/8a94ae472cb9377970860c4e69a7ebf2.webp?t=1764337040\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 While the sun is up, you can explore relatively safely.\u00a0Use that time to expand your map and move around boldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/73cb4ea23cc60399ed1a033f911d0454.webp?t=1764337040\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Once it gets dark, stronger enemies begin to appear and the danger level rises.\u00a0Return to your base quickly and get ready for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a801d4b034aafdc8bce47195ac89a320.webp?t=1764337040\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>When complete darkness falls, an indescribable malice takes over the castle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changes by Date</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, every enemy lurking in the castle gradually grows stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do their appearances change \u2013 they may gain new abilities, and even their attack patterns can change.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1764337040\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1764337040\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1764337040\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7c6878a3fea506bea14d31d3ca5206e7.apng?t=1764337040\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7c6878a3fea506bea14d31d3ca5206e7.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purify the Abandoned Chapels!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebecca can purify abandoned chapels and turn them into bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the purification is complete, you\u2019ll have to protect Rebecca from the waves of enemies that keep coming!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.poster.avif?t=1764337040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.webm?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.mp4?t=1764337040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by finding abandoned chapels and moving your base through purification can you explore deeper into the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once a chapel has been purified, you can use transport to warp there instantly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>A Vast Gothic Castle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From corridors to underground waterways, spires, and otherworldly spaces\u2014run through a castle that\u2019s both beautiful and eerie,\u00a0and discover hidden items and secret shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Story-Driven</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the missing knights and listen to their stories. You\u2019ll follow the process of uncovering the truth behind the tragedy that occurred at this castle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf13 <strong>Changes Over Time</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your day while looking at the map. Actively explore during the daytime, then return safely to your base at night and get ready for tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Five Unique Weapons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain five distinct weapons, each with its own personality,\u00a0and choose the one that fits your play style to upgrade and grow stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>Collect Bibles and Stellastones</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Bibles and Stellastones scattered throughout the castle to unlock Enoch\u2019s abilities and wield powerful holy magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude08\u00a0<strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, no Metroidvania is complete without boss fights! Take on mighty bosses and savor the thrill of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Defense &amp; Purification</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abandoned chapels and purify them.\u00a0A defense mode, where you must protect Sister Rebecca\u00a0from demons attacking from all sides, adds even more tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LHCB"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/587694c60713b8acae5be8617d016d2f798edab9/header.jpg?t=1764337040","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2889740/1766137077/0253c59bc042a697962fa814c76264c96798be45/1762150739/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762151357","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2889740/1766137077/0253c59bc042a697962fa814c76264c96798be45/1762150739/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762151357","highligh